### DSA Server — API Examples
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000

### ── Health ──
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### ── Public ──

### Get published events
GET http://localhost:5000/api/public/events

### Get societies
GET http://localhost:5000/api/public/societies

### Event signup
POST http://localhost:5000/api/public/event-signups
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "REPLACE_WITH_EVENT_ID",
  "name": "Ali Ahmed",
  "regNo": "PU-2026-100",
  "department": "Computer Science",
  "programme": "BS",
  "semester": 3,
  "email": "ali@pu.edu.pk",
  "phone": "03001234567",
  "role": "Participant",
  "category": "Web Design"
}

### Society application
POST http://localhost:5000/api/public/society-applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "societySlug": "media",
  "name": "Sara Khan",
  "regNo": "PU-2026-200",
  "department": "Mass Communication",
  "programme": "BS",
  "semester": 2,
  "email": "sara@pu.edu.pk",
  "phone": "03009876543",
  "applyingAs": "General member"
}

### Submit complaint
POST http://localhost:5000/api/public/complaints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Student",
  "regNo": "PU-2026-300",
  "department": "English",
  "programme": "BS",
  "semester": 4,
  "email": "complaint@pu.edu.pk",
  "phone": "03111111111",
  "category": "Other",
  "subject": "Test complaint subject",
  "details": "This is a detailed description of the complaint with enough characters to pass validation."
}

### Track complaint
POST http://localhost:5000/api/public/complaints/track
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ref": "CMP-2026-0001",
  "regNo": "PU-2026-300"
}

### ── Auth ──

### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "REPLACE_WITH_PASSWORD"
}

### Current user (requires cookie from login)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/auth/me

### Logout
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/auth/logout

### ── Admin: Stats ──
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/stats

### ── Admin: Events ──
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/events

### Create event
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Competition 2026",
  "society": "DSA",
  "level": "University",
  "start": "2026-11-01",
  "end": "2026-11-02",
  "venue": "University of the Punjab"
}

### Update event
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/admin/events/REPLACE_WITH_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "venue": "New Venue"
}

### Delete event
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/admin/events/REPLACE_WITH_ID

### ── Admin: Students ──
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/students?q=&page=1&limit=50

### Create student
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sample Student",
  "regNo": "PU-2026-999",
  "department": "Chemistry",
  "programme": "BS",
  "semester": 3
}

### ── Admin: Registrations ──
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/registrations?eventId=REPLACE_WITH_EVENT_ID

### Create registration
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "REPLACE_WITH_EVENT_ID",
  "studentId": "REPLACE_WITH_STUDENT_ID",
  "role": "Participant"
}

### ── Admin: Event Signups ──
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/event-signups?status=Pending

### Update signup status
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/admin/event-signups/REPLACE_WITH_ID/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Approved"
}

### Approve signup (creates student + registration)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/event-signups/REPLACE_WITH_ID/approve

### ── Admin: Society Applications ──
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/society-applications?status=Pending

### Update application status
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/admin/society-applications/REPLACE_WITH_ID/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Approved"
}

### ── Admin: Complaints ──
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/complaints?status=New

### Get complaint detail
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/complaints/REPLACE_WITH_ID

### Respond to complaint
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/admin/complaints/REPLACE_WITH_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "In review",
  "response": "We are looking into this matter."
}

### ── Admin: User Management (superadmin) ──
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/users

### Create admin user
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "staffmember",
  "name": "Staff Member",
  "password": "secure-pass-10",
  "role": "admin"
}
